explanation": "Accountability means responsibility to the people.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "02d3d518-1fb6-4caf-941a-e7fb23f75685", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The concept of \"rule of law\" means:", "options": ["Supremacy of the law", "Supremacy of the president", "Supremacy of the military", "No law"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Rule of law means supremacy of the law.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "a147f553-abd9-4f97-9cdb-e9c8fe5adb9e", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The concept of \"constitutionalism\" means:", "options": ["Government according to the constitution", "Government without constitution", "Military government", "No government"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Constitutionalism means government according to the constitution.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "e12a59ab-b5d4-4af3-ad16-1703848f06fa", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian youth are encouraged to participate in:", "options": ["Politics", "Crime", "Violence", "Corruption"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "Youth are encouraged to participate in politics.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "cd8975a6-64f4-435e-878c-51899385ade7", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian voter registration is conducted by:", "options": ["INEC", "EFCC", "ICPC", "NOA"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "INEC conducts voter registration.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "bed93a9b-d6bc-4389-8568-9d9c75efe0cc", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The slogan \"Unity and Faith, Peace and Progress\" is from the:", "options": ["Nige