, "By the Senate", "By the House of Representatives"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The vice president is elected along with the president.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "1760da5b-7b19-4791-a454-5c8ee1f75798", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian House of Representatives is headed by:", "options": ["The Speaker", "The Senate President", "The President", "The Chief Justice"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The House of Representatives is headed by the Speaker.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "3672a55e-9045-46c4-91d1-c0f8ca3eb54b", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian Senate is headed by:", "options": ["The Senate President", "The Speaker", "The President", "The Chief Justice"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The Senate is headed by the Senate President.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "a318a93d-9fd4-4074-857c-98ed5380b3d3", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian judiciary is headed by:", "options": ["The Chief Justice", "The President", "The Senate President", "The Speaker"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The judiciary is headed by the Chief Justice.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "2ff11c29-4507-4275-87dc-47dde3d4af6b", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian constitution guarantees:", "options": ["Fundamental human rights", "Only political rights", "Only economic rights", "Only social rights"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The constitution guarantees fundamental human rights.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "63486ed1-991c-4626-9cfe-0195b4d05312", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian constitution is the:", "options": ["Supreme law of the land", "Secondary law", "Temporary law", "Optional law"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The constitution is the supreme law of the land.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "6efc9ded-eb67-4778-a8d4-232140aaecdc", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian national assembly is responsible for:", "options": ["Lawmaking", "Law enforcement", "Law interpretation", "Law review"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The national assembly is responsible for lawmaking.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "3c36ac99-39a6-4a85-9899-341db9536370", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian executive branch is headed by:", "options": ["The President", "The Chief Justice", "The Senate President", "The Speaker"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The executive branch is headed by the President.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "287e7105-16cd-4cc7-998c-06a8c1167098", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian judicial branch is headed by:", "options": ["The Chief Justice", "The President", "The Senate President", "The Speaker"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The judicial branch is headed by the Chief Justice.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "83e88427-b5a2-4311-b9ed-c6d127731270", "subject_id": "civ", "subject_name": "Civic", "type": "cbt", "year": null, "text": "The Nigerian constitution can be amended by:", "options": ["National Assembly", "President", "Chief Justice", "Military"], "correct_answer": 0, "explanation": "The constitution can be amended by the National Assembly.", "display_order": null, "passage_id": null, "batch_number": 1}, {"id": "2b10f2c0-f54c-41